RetroBar Offline — independently maintained source fork

Derived from RetroBar by Sam Johnson and RetroBar contributors.
Original project: https://github.com/dremin/RetroBar
Original license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Offline-fork modifications include removing the updater, removing network-capable
installer logic, removing external hyperlink launchers, restricting XAML theme
loading, and adding static source audit and firewall helper scripts.

This modified project is not endorsed or verified by the original author.
